name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-preassessment-q1_2026-pilot_2026'

question 'Which of the following best describes how an AI system learns?'

wrong 'A human programmer writes rules for every possible situation the AI might encounter.'
right 'The AI finds patterns in large amounts of data to make predictions or generate outputs.'
wrong 'The AI connects to the internet in real time to look up answers to any question.'
wrong 'The AI memorizes a list of correct answers provided by its creators.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

